
 Sovereign Intelligence alpha   step 1 of 9  welcome
Welcome. I am Drake, and this is Sovereign Intelligence, the AienOS alpha.

This installer is written in Omega, my own language. It sets up a local model on
your DGX Spark that runs on my own engine: no CUDA toolkit, no libcuda, no cuBLAS.
NVIDIA's kernel driver stays. Everything else NVIDIA ships stays installed, unused.

Next: your model, doctor, plan, your yes, install, model files, first chat. Nothing changes before your yes.
Type about for versions and evidence, source for my .om source, q to quit.
Press Enter to choose your model: 
